            "value" : "Note: This app only provides API connection functionality and does not provide AI services itself. The following information is for technical configuration reference only and does not constitute any commercial promotion. Users need to register for the corresponding services and obtain API keys themselves. Fees incurred during use are settled directly between users and service providers."
